Welcome to my blog. This site is built with **Next.js**, styled with **Tailwind CSS**, and powered by [Keystatic](https://keystatic.com) — a Git-based CMS that stores every post as a file right here in the repository.

## Why this setup

There's no external database and no third-party CMS to log into. Content lives as plain files next to the code, which means:

- Everything is version-controlled and reviewable in a pull request
- The whole site builds to static HTML and deploys to the edge
- I can edit posts visually at `/keystatic`, or just open the files in my editor

## Writing code

Code blocks are syntax-highlighted with `sugar-high`:

```ts
function greet(name: string): string {
  return `Hello, ${name}!`;
}

console.log(greet('world'));
```

More to come soon.
